  "description": "Operating Area: Corsica, Marseille, Balearic Is., Italy, Sardinia\n\nThe Oyster 825 Champagne Hippy epitomizes opulence on the high seas, boasting a majestic 25-meter profile renowned for her unparalleled performance, graceful design, and abundant onboard features. With lavish lodgings for up to 6 guests across 3 sumptuous cabins, complemented by dedicated crew quarters, this masterpiece, conceived and crafted by Oyster Yachts, seamlessly harmonizes chic aesthetics with artisanal craftsmanship and luxurious design. \n\nFollowing an extensive and transformative refit, culminating in June 2023, this yacht has undergone a magnificent metamorphosis. She now stands as the zenith of luxury, ensuring paramount safety, contemporary style, and optimal functionality for those privileged enough to set sail aboard her.",
